        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yamthanda u-Esteri ngaphezu kwabo bonke abesifazane, wathola umusa nesihe emehlweni ayo ngaphezu kwazo zonke izintombi; wayesemthwesa umqhele wobukhosi, wamenza indlovukazi esikhundleni sikaVashiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.2.17"
            ]
