              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalezo zinsuku lapho uMoridekayi ehlezi esangweni lenkosi, izinceku ezimbili zenkosi, uBhigithani noTeresi, ababeqapha umnyango, bathukuthela bazama ukubeka isandla enkosini u-Ahashiveroshi.",
          "type": "text",
